oaxaca-fonts (3.5.1+ia20261002-0oaxaca1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Initial release (roadmap step 6): the two font families the desktop
    names and Ubuntu's archive lacks. JetBrains Mono Nerd Font, the four
    basic faces from the Nerd Fonts 3.5.1 release zip (the shell, the
    terminal and the editor ask for "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font" and its icon
    glyphs), and the 16 iA Writer TTFs Omarchy pins (Mono S, Quattro S and
    Duo S from iaolo/iA-Fonts commit c6588670 of 2026-10-02; Duospace from
    commit b337fe1a, the last one carrying that family). The upstream
    version names the Nerd Fonts release and the iA-Fonts commit date.
  * The orig tarball is assembled by scripts/build.sh from the file list
    in sources.list (see the "upstream" file next to debian/); the Nerd
    Fonts zip is unpacked at build time, so unzip is a build dependency.
  * Files install under /usr/share/fonts/truetype/oaxaca/; fontconfig's
    own file trigger on /usr/share/fonts rebuilds the cache, so no snippet
    or maintainer script is shipped.

 -- santisbon <santisbon@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0500
